{"data":{"body":"**P1:** This drains only `flushingQueue`; an item already moved into `flushingItems` remains pending while `executeBatch` runs. If another hook publishes a fatal during a blocked backend call, an at-most-once START worker remains stuck on its future, and shutdown waits instead of propagating the fatal. Track the active batch so abort fails its futures, avoid joining that backend call after terminal failure, and add a blocked-`executeBatch` regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76fmXn","finding_digest":"9f673fbc532d3bb319a37ac6eed85cfafbe8a874746fdee211ea91ae64b5c677","finding_id":"arf_v1_t5tt7pctfu53ggndpldo5wc47l","finding_key":"sdk/execution/async-request-delayed-batcher::abort-pending::inflight-items-not-failed","identity_key":"sdk/execution/async-request-delayed-batcher::abort-pending::inflight-items-not-failed","line":272,"observation_digest":"282dcfcbb255a8c1f064ec6d4ed608934c9e8798e0679da111bbf46b5bd17cb5","observation_id":"aro_v1_faw47s5skwumd4de5rwu5vqisn","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ApiRequestDelayedBatcher.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T02:52:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nue4razljcnmmthk65qacc3de2","reviewed_base_sha":"3a49c5a96d4121899c9336ae39f38f23d2fd1219","reviewed_head_sha":"c8b48be00363c6112c56061ea0703c96c6ed8a34","reviewer":"codex","start_line":272,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_mqwqbuhack6tfkvpi455hhzith","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T02:52:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
